ow these steps.", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[572, 1370], [1538, 1355], [1539, 1402], [573, 1417]]}, {"text": "Step I: First, change the operation from subtraction to addition and change the sign of the", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[204, 1496], [1824, 1460], [1825, 1519], [205, 1554]]}, {"text": "integer that is to be subtracted.", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[341, 1557], [909, 1545], [910, 1587], [342, 1600]]}, {"text": "Step Ill: Then, add these according to rules of addition of integers.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[226, 1607], [1418, 1590], [1418, 1638], [226, 1656]]}, {"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.855, "box": [[231, 1673], [446, 1670], [446, 1714], [231, 1717]]}, {"text": "A point A on the top of the mountain is 3500 m above the sea level and a point B is", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[229, 1730], [1731, 1706], [1732, 1760], [230, 1785]]}, {"text": "2000 m below sea level. Find the vertical distance between points A and B.", "conf": 0.953, "box": [[234, 1793], [1558, 1778], [1558, 1827], [234, 1841]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.843, "box": [[237, 1862], [415, 1857], [416, 1897], [238, 1903]]}, {"text": "If we take sea level as O, then:", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[239, 1923], [773, 1913], [773, 1953], [239, 1963]]}, {"text": "PointA=+3500m", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[245, 1987], [591, 1978], [592, 2015], [246, 2024]]}, {"text": "PointB=-2000m", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[247, 2049], [588, 2039], [589, 2078], [248, 2088]]}, {"text": "Difference =3500-(-2000)", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[248, 2109], [771, 2097], [772, 2139], [249, 2150]]}, {"text": "=3500+2000", "conf": 0.854, "box": [[473, 2166], [735, 2161], [736, 2198], [474, 2203]]}, {"text": "=+5500m", "conf": 0.854, "box": [[475, 2227], [678, 2223], [678, 2260], [475, 2264]]}, {"text": "43", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[1037, 2402], [1093, 2402], [1093, 2445], [1037, 2445]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.823, "box": [[357, 2412], [688, 2396], [690, 2433], [359, 2449]]}]}